le.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| COM-000 | sms | v3 | 89.0 | percent-delivered | superseded |\n| COM-001 | radio | v3 | 90.7 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-002 | web | v3 | 89.5 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-003 | call-center | v3 | 91.2 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-004 | sms | v3 | 90.0 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-005 | radio | v3 | 91.7 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-006 | web | v3 | 90.5 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-007 | call-center | v3 | 89.3 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-008 | sms | v3 | 91.0 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-009 | radio | v3 | 89.8 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-010 | web | v3 | 91.5 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-011 | call-center | v3 | 90.3 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-012 | sms | v3 | 89.1 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-013 | radio | v4 | 90.8 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-014 | web | v4 | 89.6 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-015 | call-center | v4 | 91.3 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-016 | sms | v4 | 90.1 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-017 | radio | v4 | 91.8 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-018 | web | v4 | 90.6 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-019 | call-center | v4 | 89.4 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-020 | sms | v4 | 91.1 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-021 | radio | v4 | 89.9 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-022 | web | v4 | 91.6 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-023 | call-center | v4 | 90.4 | percent-delivered | superseded |\n| COM-024 | sms | v4 | 89.2 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-025 | radio | v4 | 90.9 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-026 | web | v5 | 89.7 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-027 | call-center | v5 | 91.4 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-028 | sms | v5 | 90.2 | percent-delivered | current |\n| COM-029 | radio | v5 | 89.0 | 