ndently\nauthorize operations, readiness, submission, or closure.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Trellis construction action contract\n\nReturn exactly one JSON action object and no prose.\n\n```text\n{\"action\":\"read_source\",\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60},{\"source_id\":\"CLIMATE\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}]}\n{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-001\"}\n{\"action\":\"replace_evidence_ledger\",\"content\":\"complete compact task-native evidence-to-requirement matrix\"}\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and operating states\",\"body\":\"exact section body\"}\n{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"exact unique text\",\"new\":\"replacement text\"}]}\n{\"action\":\"replace_decision\",\"content\":\"complete exact decision\"}\n{\"action\":\"begin_verification\"}\n```\n\nOne read may contain at most 120 lines. A batch may contain one or two ranges,\nat most 160 lines and 12,000 exact source bytes. Incremental ledger and section\nwork is exact, versioned task state and remains available after source bodies\nleave residency. `begin_verification` is valid only after the frozen mechanical\nconstruction milestone. It changes lifecycle phase, not candidate bytes, and\ndoes not assert readiness.\n\n\n# Common pre-fork action notice\nNo semantic-maintenance output is present during pressure screening. Both future configurations share this ordinary action surface and exact task work.\n\n# Exact source catalog\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-source-catalog-v0\",\"sources\":[{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"1dcfd09e66f004f0cf3b7849dcc7ca097d4d6135809649c33d6cb1784dac88ea\",\"size_bytes\":5794,\"source_id\":\"COUNCIL\",\"title\":\"Heat emergency authority and public operating states\"},{\"line_count\":94,\"sha256\":\"163e45cdae8f3d164079e68b4f2a1386df81616b32290eb79e51bd2ccde99ca7