odel, or candidate site roster makes prior shelter evidence stale.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nGRID and WATER constrain usable capacity, LABOR supplies coverage, TRANSIT shapes arrival, and CLIMATE determines district staging.\nREVIEW requires current accessibility and capacity evidence; an artifact cannot self-certify a center.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| SHL-000 | library-hub | v3 | 2100.0 | installed-seats | superseded |\n| SHL-001 | arena | v3 | 2101.7 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-002 | school-east | v3 | 2100.5 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-003 | mobile-center | v3 | 2102.2 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-004 | library-hub | v3 | 2101.0 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-005 | arena | v3 | 2102.7 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-006 | school-east | v3 | 2101.5 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-007 | mobile-center | v3 | 2100.3 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-008 | library-hub | v3 | 2102.0 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-009 | arena | v3 | 2100.8 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-010 | school-east | v3 | 2102.5 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-011 | mobile-center | v3 | 2101.3 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-012 | library-hub | v3 | 2100.1 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-013 | arena | v4 | 2101.8 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-014 | school-east | v4 | 2100.6 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-015 | mobile-center | v4 | 2102.3 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-016 | library-hub | v4 | 2101.1 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-017 | arena | v4 | 2102.8 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-018 | school-east | v4 | 2101.6 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-019 | mobile-center | v4 | 2100.4 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-020 | library-hub | v4 | 2102.1 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-021 | arena | v4 | 2100.9 | installed-seats | current |\n| SHL-022 | school-east | v4 | 2102.6 | installed-